(7477993, 1188478, 17850, '<td valign="top">All right, I would like to give first the definition of Photography according to my humble opinion. So, Photography is a mixture of Imaging and Art. Having said that, every single picture could be just a snapshot or just an artwork. Could be of course something exceptional, poorly defined as 50-50. <br/>Your contribution has nothing to do with imaging. It is pure Art. I am still wondering why I gave it a 9. This is one of the best ever Artworks in DPC, a submission beyond any competition.<br/>Thanks once again for the inspiration!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-10-10 08:45:59.</i></td>', 'All right, I would like to give first the definition of Photography according to my humble opinion. So, Photography is a mixture of Imaging and Art. Having said that, every single picture could be just a snapshot or just an artwork. Could be of course something exceptional, poorly defined as 50-50. Your contribution has nothing to do with imaging. It is pure Art. I am still wondering why I gave it a 9. This is one of the best ever Artworks in DPC, a submission beyond any competition.Thanks once again for the inspiration!', '2016-10-10 09:44:34.000000', '2016-10-10 09:45:59.000000', 0),
