(7478048, 1188478, 152252, '<td valign="top">My second 10 in this challenge. Wonderful reflections, colors, creativity and composition. Love it. Congrats on a beautiful photograph! I was hoping for a ribbon here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-10-10 19:31:05.</i></td>', 'My second 10 in this challenge. Wonderful reflections, colors, creativity and composition. Love it. Congrats on a beautiful photograph! I was hoping for a ribbon here.', '2016-10-10 20:29:23.000000', '2016-10-10 20:31:05.000000', 0),
(7478050, 1188463, 59029, '<td valign="top">Heh, like many others here I''d be surprised if you didn''t win or at least place, Paul!  Great work and congrats on the blue :-)</td>', 'Heh, like many others here I''d be surprised if you didn''t win or at least place, Paul!  Great work and congrats on the blue :-)', '2016-10-10 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478051, 1188476, 59029, '<td valign="top">This one is so frickin funny...because it IS a sitting bull, glowering at you and just daring you to make fun of him for sitting by his fence!  A very well deserved ribbon.  Congrats on the red! :-)</td>', 'This one is so frickin funny...because it IS a sitting bull, glowering at you and just daring you to make fun of him for sitting by his fence!  A very well deserved ribbon.  Congrats on the red! :-)', '2016-10-10 20:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478052, 1188522, 59029, '<td valign="top">What you said in your notes...the incongruous nature of the shot, with a  lone bovine (can''t see if it''s a steer or a bull) and in the middle of a winding country lane instead of in a pasture with its herdmates.  Would love to know the backstory, hope he got home safely.  Very well seen and captured.  Congrats on the ribbon! :-)</td>', 'What you said in your notes...the incongruous nature of the shot, with a  lone bovine (can''t see if it''s a steer or a bull) and in the middle of a winding country lane instead of in a pasture with its herdmates.  Would love to know the backstory, hope he got home safely.  Very well seen and captured.  Congrats on the ribbon! :-)', '2016-10-10 20:59:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478053, 1188457, 59029, '<td valign="top">Laughed at your shot, and now your  shoot notes, in a good way :-) I figured I''d be seeing your guy and mine in close proximity!  Congrats on the HM :-)</td>', 'Laughed at your shot, and now your  shoot notes, in a good way :-) I figured I''d be seeing your guy and mine in close proximity!  Congrats on the HM :-)', '2016-10-10 21:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
