(7478073, 1188490, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>What a gorgeous beast! A lovely ''in yer face'' portrait of a lovely animal, good focus on the eyes and good DOF to get the muzzle nicely focused too. I see you''re definitely in high-key mode with your recent entries, whilst it serves to create a more unique image I feel its just borderline slightly overexposed, there is some loss of detail in the whites around the muzzle and his flanks below. Perhaps I''m being over-critical but for me blown highlights are something to be avoided at all costs. Having said that I love the detail in his fur especially around the top of the head and ears it makes him look so adorable. This brings back fond memories of a similar shot I took a long time ago and she has since become my avatar. Anyway, congratulations on the high score and HM, well done Susan.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge What a gorgeous beast! A lovely ''in yer face'' portrait of a lovely animal, good focus on the eyes and good DOF to get the muzzle nicely focused too. I see you''re definitely in high-key mode with your recent entries, whilst it serves to create a more unique image I feel its just borderline slightly overexposed, there is some loss of detail in the whites around the muzzle and his flanks below. Perhaps I''m being over-critical but for me blown highlights are something to be avoided at all costs. Having said that I love the detail in his fur especially around the top of the head and ears it makes him look so adorable. This brings back fond memories of a similar shot I took a long time ago and she has since become my avatar. Anyway, congratulations on the high score and HM, well done Susan.', '2016-10-11 06:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478074, 1188449, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>This is a nice documentary style shot of these lovely animals going about their everyday activities. We don''t have many of these over here in England, I don''t suppose you were in any danger but the one looking at you looks a bit mean! They form a nice trio from the lovely large one feeding to the one on the left whilst grooming still has her eye on you. I''m sure you''re right about the snow, I for one, wouldn''t have realised there is snow on the ground, as you say, well spotted Annie. Thanks for your entry Janine.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge This is a nice documentary style shot of these lovely animals going about their everyday activities. We don''t have many of these over here in England, I don''t suppose you were in any danger but the one looking at you looks a bit mean! They form a nice trio from the lovely large one feeding to the one on the left whilst grooming still has her eye on you. I''m sure you''re right about the snow, I for one, wouldn''t have realised there is snow on the ground, as you say, well spotted Annie. Thanks for your entry Janine.', '2016-10-11 06:23:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478075, 1188463, 118703, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Paul, very well done, great looking cow, with great DOF</td>', 'Congratulations Paul, very well done, great looking cow, with great DOF', '2016-10-11 07:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478076, 1188490, 67688, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.. great to see the snaffles  name back on the front page..<br/> Looking forward to many more..Love the way the steer is looking right at you..makes you feel humbled by its size and majestic appearance. works great in B/W  ..LOVE IT!!</td>', 'Gorgeous.. great to see the snaffles  name back on the front page.. Looking forward to many more..Love the way the steer is looking right at you..makes you feel humbled by its size and majestic appearance. works great in B/W  ..LOVE IT!!', '2016-10-11 07:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
