(7478167, 1188029, 12611, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing and everything else about this shot. I am still trying to process the second cow, the one in the front. I realize you have no mental control over cows, but I wonder if the story would have been better with only the cow in the back in the shot. Either way, terrific.</td>', 'I really like the processing and everything else about this shot. I am still trying to process the second cow, the one in the front. I realize you have no mental control over cows, but I wonder if the story would have been better with only the cow in the back in the shot. Either way, terrific.', '2016-10-12 11:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478208, 1188476, 75713, '<td valign="top">Oh my - you''re brave.  Beautifully seen and photographed. Congratulations.</td>', 'Oh my - you''re brave.  Beautifully seen and photographed. Congratulations.', '2016-10-12 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
